        "title": "feat(ledger): record command action lifecycles",
        "body": "## Summary\n\n- add immutable command receipt chains for received, classified, claimed, claim-refreshed, dispatched, recovered, waiting, skipped, completed, and failed router transitions\n- record command-status comment progress and report-only repair requeues, forwarding a stable `dispatch_key` into the worker dedupe gate\n- bind operations to stable command versions/source revisions while separating explicit workflow-step attempts and business idempotency\n- publish router, late exact-review status, and report/requeue receipt shards immutably to the state repository\n\n## Validation\n\n- `pnpm --config.verify-deps-before-run=false run build:all`\n- router/workflow/action-ledger focused suites: 232 passed\n- status/requeue/workflow focused suites: 110 passed\n- command receipt identity suite: passed\n- `pnpm --config.verify-deps-before-run=false run lint:repair`\n- `pnpm --config.verify-deps-before-run=false run format:check`\n- `git diff --check`\n\n## Stack\n\n- depends on https://github.com/openclaw/clawsweeper/pull/512 for the immutable action-ledger runtime and setup action\n- will be rebased and retargeted to `main` after that dependency lands",
